**/target/
/build
__pycache__/

# Nix build symlink (from `nix build` / `nix run`)
/result
/result-*

# Local-only deploy scripts (contain RPC URLs / API keys — never commit)
*.local.sh

# CycloneDX SBOM release sidecars (regenerate with `make sbom`)
*.cdx.json

# Per-developer MCP server config (SOTA 2026-06 §7 egress discipline). Holds
# absolute local paths and could one day hold a network/secret-bearing server
# — keep it user-local so it can't be accidentally committed. The REQUIRED
# minimal shape (lean-lsp only; never a server with both repo-secret read and a
# network tool) is documented in docs/tooling-and-systems.md.
.mcp.json

# local RPC endpoints for tools/verify_erc20_decimals.py (may contain secret keys)
tools/erc20_rpc.json

# cargo-mutants output (regenerate with `make mutants`) — large, machine-local
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/
# optiga-reset manifest/fragment build output (gen_reset_manifests.py OUT_DIR)
tools/optiga_reset/out/
# Serena MCP plugin project cache (per-checkout, machine-local)
.serena/

# EasyCrypt build artifacts
contracts/verification/easycrypt/**/*.eco

# Vendor-copyrighted material — licenses do not permit redistribution.
# Local copies live outside the repo in ~/Documents/PQ1/vendor-docs/.
# (Purged from git history 2026-07-22 before open-sourcing.)
*.pdf
# ...except our own board documentation, which is open source. Listed per
# directory, so the vendor-doc directories below stay excluded.
!docs/hardware/pcb/*.pdf
!docs/hardware/schematics/*.pdf
docs/secure-elements/SE050/SE-PLUG-TRUST-MW_04.07.01/
docs/SE050E2HQ1_Z01Z3Z/
docs/SLS32AIA010MKUSON10XTMA2/

# Bench photos / local artifacts
IMG_*.jpg
